# iFINITEAi2025JESSICAi — Huntress Edition

> **Next-generation autonomous security platform** with full Kali + BlackArch + WiFi Pineapple suites, CHAiMERA chained-workflow orchestration, ConductorX clustered super orchestration, and AI-powered transformer bots.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🔧 Full Security Tool Suites
- **Kali Linux Suite** — nmap, Wireshark, Metasploit, Nikto, Ettercap, Aircrack-ng, Hydra, John, Hashcat, SQLMap, Gobuster, and 30+ more tools
- **BlackArch Suite** — Bloodhound, Responder, Amass, Ghidra, Radare2, Chisel, and 15+ extended tools
- **PineAP Suite** — Full WiFi Pineapple emulation: KARMA/MANA attacks, evil twin, probe harvesting, deauth, captive portal

### 🧠 CHAiMERA Chained Workflow Engine
- **3×3×3 Stack Overlay** — 27-cell spatial execution grid (depth × width × height)
- **Chain Types** — sequential, parallel, conditional, loop, fan-out/fan-in
- **Hot-Swap** — switch between parallel ↔ series execution at runtime
- **Pre-built Templates** — full_recon, full_pentest, wireless_audit, network_sniff

### 🎛️ ConductorX Clustered Super Orchestration
- **Raft consensus** cluster for high availability
- **Adaptive scheduling** with priority-based task dispatch
- **Auto-scaling workers** — 3 to 50 replicas based on queue depth
- **Multiple strategies** — adaptive, round-robin, priority, least-loaded

### 🤖 AI Transformer Bots (Hugging Face)
- **Full uncensored model access** — any Hugging Face model
- **Transformer bot roles** — Classifier, Analyser, Planner, Scorer
- **Model placement control** — CPU ↔ GPU hot-migration
- **Parallel & series inference** — chain models in any topology

### 🛡️ Autonomous Monitoring
- **All ports** — continuous TCP/UDP scan of localhost
- **All USB** — USB-A / USB-C device insertion/removal detection
- **All WiFi** — interface and network change detection
- **All drivers** — kernel module loading alerts
- **All interfaces** — network interface state tracking

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Install
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
pytest

# Launch
jessica --mode autonomous
```

### Docker (Full Stack)

```bash
export HF_TOKEN="hf_..."
docker-compose up -d
```

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
jessica/
├── core/           # Engine, autonomous monitor, port control
├── chimera/        # CHAiMERA chain engine, 3×3×3 stack overlay, workflows
├── conductor/      # ConductorX orchestrator, scalable workers, transformer bots
├── suites/         # Kali, BlackArch, PineAP tool adapters
├── network/        # Interface management, scanning, monitor mode
├── ai/             # Hugging Face integration layer
└── cli.py          # Command-line interface

configs/            # YAML configurations for all suites and orchestration
tests/              # Test suite
docs/               # Architecture and setup documentation
```

---

## 🛠️ CLI Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `jessica` | Launch in autonomous mode (default) |
| `jessica --mode conductor` | ConductorX orchestrator only |
| `jessica scan --target IP` | Quick network scan |
| `jessica scan --target IP --full` | Full scan with service/OS detection |
| `jessica workflow --template NAME --target TARGET` | Run a CHAiMERA workflow |
| `jessica suites` | List installed security tools |
| `jessica interfaces` | List all network interfaces |
| `jessica health` | Platform health check |

